-- en: "Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."
L["Each callback keeps its own pending text while switching tabs. Undo and Redo edit that callback buffer. Reset restores its last saved code, or the template for a new condition, and can be undone. The main Apply saves and registers all callback buffers and metadata; Discard drops the whole draft. Leaving with changes offers Apply, Discard or Cancel. Check syntax runs no callbacks."] = "Cada callback mantém o próprio texto pendente ao trocar de aba. Desfazer e Refazer editam o buffer desse callback. Redefinir restaura o último código salvo, ou o modelo de uma nova condição, e pode ser desfeito. O Aplicar principal salva e registra todos os buffers de callback e os metadados; Descartar elimina o rascunho inteiro. Sair com alterações oferece Aplicar, Descartar ou Cancelar. Verificar sintaxe não executa nenhum callback."
