-- en: "Check whether a spell can be recommended now, allowing a spell whose remaining cooldown ends with the current global cooldown. On Retail and Forever, where cooldown times are secret in combat, readiness comes from the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags instead. This checks cooldown readiness only; it does not check learned status, range or resource usability. Pass evaluation time from evalStart or GetTime()."
L["Check whether a spell can be recommended now, allowing a spell whose remaining cooldown ends with the current global cooldown. On Retail and Forever, where cooldown times are secret in combat, readiness comes from the never-secret isEnabled, isActive and isOnGCD flags instead. This checks cooldown readiness only; it does not check learned status, range or resource usability. Pass evaluation time from evalStart or GetTime()."] = "Verifica se um feitiço pode ser recomendado agora, permitindo um feitiço cujo tempo de recarga restante termina junto com o tempo de recarga global atual. No Retail e no Forever, onde os tempos de recarga são secretos em combate, a prontidão vem das flags isEnabled, isActive e isOnGCD, que nunca são secretas. Verifica apenas a prontidão do tempo de recarga; não verifica se o feitiço foi aprendido, o alcance nem se há recursos para usá-lo. Passe o tempo de avaliação a partir de evalStart ou GetTime()."
-- en: "Check whether a table has a non-nil value at a key. A stored false value still counts as present; this does not scan table values."
