-- en: "Fresh readable record with active, then name or nameReason, remainingSeconds, durationSeconds, interruptible and spellID. Remaining time and duration are in seconds; remaining time is clamped to zero. An unavailable optional field has its own reason; it does not invalidate an active record."
L["Fresh readable record with active, then name or nameReason, remainingSeconds, durationSeconds, interruptible and spellID. Remaining time and duration are in seconds; remaining time is clamped to zero. An unavailable optional field has its own reason; it does not invalidate an active record."] = "Registro novo e legível com active e, em seguida, name ou nameReason, remainingSeconds, durationSeconds, interruptible e spellID. O tempo restante e a duração estão em segundos; o tempo restante é limitado a zero. Um campo opcional indisponível tem seu próprio motivo; ele não invalida um registro ativo."
-- en: "Fresh readable record with exists and, when present, a positive integer level."
